 SAFE | Branch | Purchase \u00f7 Cap | Conversion price | Conversion shares |\n|---|---|---|---:|---:|\n| `SAFE1-01` | `cap_and_discount_branch` | \u2014 | $0.6484 | 385,571 |\n\n_Provenance: rules: `safe.post_money_cap_conversion`_\n\n## Scenario Comparison\n\n| Scenario | Completeness | Founder %  | Equity Price |\n|---|---|---:|---:|\n| Cap-implied SAFE + Note (structural only) | structural_only | \u2014 | \u2014 |\n| Series Seed \u2014 M pre / M raise | full | 64.8% | $0.8105 |\n\n## Counsel Review Required\n\n### Delaware Cross Border\n- **QSBS rules are date-sensitive** (`delaware_cross_border.qsbs_date_sensitive`)\n  - US QSBS eligibility and exclusion amounts are date-sensitive and changed for stock issued after July 4, 2025 under OBBBA; cap-table scripts should flag issue date and tax counsel review.\n\n## Date-Sensitive Watchlist\n\n_14 active item(s) \u2014 rules whose predicates match this engagement._\n\n| Rule | Scope | Status | Date | Action |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `safe.israeli_2025_safe_harbor` | legal_tax_applicability | in_window | 2025-01-15 | Counsel review required before treating a SAFE as equity-lik |\n| `safe.israeli_safe_facts_circumstances` | legal_tax_applicability | in_window | 2025-01-15 | Escalate to Israeli tax counsel before modeling tax, withhol |\n| `convertible_notes.qualified_financing_threshold` | benchmark_freshness | unknown | \u2014 | Set benchmark_reference_date in inputs.event_dates to use cu |\n| `israel_equity_tax.section_102_capital_gains` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide grant_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `israel_equity_tax.section_102_plan_design` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide grant_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `israel_equity_tax.section_102_double_trigger` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide transaction_event_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `israel_equity_tax.section_3i_nonemployee` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide grant_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `israeli_ltd.registrar_online_reporting` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide filing_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `delaware_cross_border.section_102_parent_shares` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide grant_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `delaware_cross_border.transfer_pricing_ip` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide tax_position_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `delaware_cross_border.qsbs_date_sensitive` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide stock_issue_date on the relevant instance. |\n| `delaware_flip.ruling_path` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide restructuring_approval_date on the relevant instance |\n| `delaware_flip.part_e2_repeal` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide restructuring_effective_date on the relevant instanc |\n| `delaware_flip.options_convertibles` | legal_tax_applicability | missing_event_date | \u2014 | Provide flip_closing_date on the relevant instance. |\n\n## Sources Cited\n\n- `TAXADVISER-QSBS-OBBBA`\n\n---\n\n<!-- COACHING_INSERTION_POINT_0c180669 -->\n\n---\n\n*Generated by [founder skills](https://github.com/lool-ventures/founder-skills) by [lool ventures](https://lool.vc) \u2014 Cap Table Agent \u00b7 [Share feedback](https://github.com/lool-ventures/founder-skills/discussions/new?category=ideas-feedback)*\n",
